{
"#name"
:
{
"x outerr"
:
null
,
"zh"
:
"X 内置通过前缀处理错误信息"
,
"en"
:
"X built-in handle error message PREFIX symbol"
}
,
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"该模块用于合并标准输出流和异常流；并通过在合并流中使用特殊前缀 PREFIX 标识输出流，可以在后期将合并流还原成输出流和异常流。\n为了能够更好作用于yml，当前 PRFIX 定义成为转义序列(001+002+003: ___X_CMD_OUTERR_MIX_PACK_PREFIX)。\n"
,
"en"
:
"This module is used to merge the standard output stream and the exception stream; and by using the special prefix PREFIX to identify the output stream in the merged stream, the merged stream can be restored to the output stream and the exception stream later.\nIn order to better act on yml, the current PRFIX definition becomes an escape sequence(001+002+003: ___X_CMD_OUTERR_MIX_PACK_PREFIX)\n"
}
,
"pack"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"合并标准输出流和异常流"
,
"en"
:
"Add PREFIX to each line of error messages"
}
,
"#option"
:
{
"--awk|-a"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 AWK 实现。通常适用于长时间运行的进程。"
,
"en"
:
"use AWK implemenation. Normally it suits for long running process."
}
}
}
}
,
"unpack"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"从流中分离出标准输出流和异常流"
,
"en"
:
"Delete PREFIX to each line of error messages"
}
,
"#option"
:
{
"--awk|-a"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 AWK 实现。通常适用于长时间运行的进程。"
,
"en"
:
"use AWK implemenation. Normally it suits for long running process."
}
}
}
}
,
"out"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 PREFIX 输出错误消息"
,
"en"
:
"Output error messages with PREFIX"
}
,
"#option"
:
{
"--awk|-a"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"使用 AWK 实现。通常适用于长时间运行的进程。"
,
"en"
:
"use AWK implemenation. Normally it suits for long running process."
}
}
}
}
,
"err"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"输出错误消息不使用 PREFIX"
,
"en"
:
